{
    "comment": "주문서의 적립금 사용 칸 — 회원이면서 이 주문에 적립금을 쓸 수 있을 때만 보인다. 사용 한도는\n     화면이 정하지 않고 서버가 준 `max_usable` 을 그대로 쓴다(주문 금액·정책에 따라 달라지므로).",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "마일리지 사용 섹션 - 보유 마일리지 표시 및 사용 금액 입력 (PC/모바일 반응형, 로그인 사용자만)"
    },
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{_global.currentUser?.uuid && checkoutData.data.mileage?.enabled && checkoutData.data.mileage?.usable !== false}}",
    "responsive": {
        "portable": {
            "props": {
                "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 p-4"
            }
        }
    },
    "props": {
        "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 p-6"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "comment": "섹션 헤더",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex items-center justify-between mb-3 pb-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                    }
                }
            },
            "props": {
                "className": "flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex items-center gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "coins",
                                "className": "text-xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "H2",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_section_title"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "보유 마일리지",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_available"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ml-1 font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"
                            },
                            "text": "{{(checkoutData.data.mileage?.available ?? 0).toLocaleString()}}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "comment": "마일리지 입력 영역",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "children": [
                {
                    "comment": "최대 사용 가능 안내",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(checkoutData.data.mileage?.max_usable ?? 0) > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-2"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_max_usable|amount={{(checkoutData.data.mileage?.max_usable ?? 0).toLocaleString()}}"
                },
                {
                    "comment": "입력 필드 + 전액사용 + 적용 버튼",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Input",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex-1 px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "담기만 하고 실제 반영은 옆 「적용」이 한다 — 한 글자마다 서버 계산을 부르지 않기 위해서다",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "checkout": "{{Object.assign({}, _local.checkout, { use_points: parseInt($event.target.value) || 0 })}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "name": "use_points",
                                "value": "{{_local.checkout?.use_points ?? 0}}",
                                "placeholder": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_input_placeholder",
                                "min": "0",
                                "max": "{{checkoutData.data.mileage?.max_usable ?? 0}}",
                                "className": "flex-1 px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500",
                                "disabled": "{{(checkoutData.data.mileage?.available ?? 0) === 0}}"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "전액 사용 버튼",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "checkout": "{{Object.assign({}, _local.checkout, { use_points: checkoutData.data.mileage?.max_usable ?? 0 })}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors text-sm whitespace-nowrap",
                                "disabled": "{{(checkoutData.data.mileage?.max_usable ?? 0) === 0}}"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_use_all"
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "적용 버튼",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "px-3 py-2 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-lg font-medium text-sm hover:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                    "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/checkout",
                                    "auth_mode": "optional",
                                    "params": {
                                        "method": "PUT",
                                        "body": "{{_local.checkout}}"
                                    },
                                    "onSuccess": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "updateDataSource",
                                            "params": {
                                                "dataSourceId": "checkoutData",
                                                "data": "{{response}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "toast",
                                            "params": {
                                                "type": "success",
                                                "message": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_applied"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "onError": {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "error",
                                            "message": "{{error.errors?.message ?? error.message}}"
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "px-4 py-2 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50",
                                "disabled": "{{(_local.checkout?.use_points ?? 0) === 0 && (checkoutData.data.calculation?.summary?.points_used ?? 0) === 0}}"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_apply"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "적용된 마일리지 정보",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(checkoutData.data.calculation?.summary?.points_used ?? 0) > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-2 text-sm text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 flex items-center gap-1"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "check-circle",
                                "className": "text-base"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "-{{checkoutData.data.calculation?.summary?.points_used_formatted}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "마일리지 부족 안내",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(checkoutData.data.mileage?.available ?? 0) === 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:shop.checkout.mileage_insufficient"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
